  "why": "Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You is the twelve episode summer 2026 cour, airing 2026-07-09 to 2026-09-24 on a weekly 14:45 slot.\nThe seven members (anilist:196187, anizip:19479, jw:488719-515179, kitsu:50040, mal:62076, nf:82757039-1, offline:mal-62076) are one run: anilist, kitsu, anizip and offline all map SAME_AS to mal:62076, anilist and kitsu agree on the twelve episode count and the 2026-07-09 start, and jw and nf both map SAME_AS across the whole set.\ncr:GT00378116 holds the run: a bare Crunchyroll series container with no title, count or dates, named by kitsu:50040 as PART_OF.\njw:488719 holds the run: the JustWatch title container for the show, carrying only the series title and a year level 2026-01-01 start, with jw:488719-515179 declared PART_OF it.\nnf:82757039 holds the run: the Netflix show container for the same title, with no count and a year level start, of which nf:82757039-1 is the first season.\ndisney:25eb842b-a4c2-4120-9c86-7feec790de08 holds the run: a bare Disney container with no title, count or dates, named by jw:488719-515179 as PART_OF.\nThe kitsu episodes 1 to 9 pair with anizip:19479 episodes 1 to 9 on nine exact English titles, Smoking Behind the Supermarket With You through Asking Behind the Supermarket Alone, all distinctive and none generic; kitsu 10 to 12 have no titles yet and were left alone. The JustWatch episodes 1 to 10 pair with anizip:19479 episodes 1 to 10 on those same exact titles; JustWatch 11 and 12 are only Episode 11 and Episode 12, so they pair with nothing."
